WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.560
Volume tells how many cubic units fit in a solid. Multiply length times width times

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:05.917
height.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:14.327
Find the volume of a 3 times 7 times 5 cuboid. The answer is 105 cm cubed . Volume

00:00:14.327 --> 00:00:21.077
equals length times width times height equals 3 times 7 times 5 equals 105 cm cubed .

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.827
