00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.374
Pause the video and think.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:36.584
A storage box in a craft workshop holds 3 by 6 by 2 unit cubes. What is its volume?

00:00:36.584 --> 00:00:41.960
The answer is 36 cm cubed . Volume equals length times width times height equals 3

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.984
times 6 times 2 equals 36 cm cubed .
